flowchart TB
  accTitle: Recorded Board Manager answers
  accDescr: scripts/capture_board.py records what a real board answers and replaces its ID, its keys and the addresses of its network by placeholders. The recordings of Board Manager 1.0.7, 2.0.0, 2.0.2 and 2.1.0 in tests/fixtures/board_manager are what the double of the unit tests and that of the Docker end-to-end test answer. tests/test_board_contract.py checks that both answer every route in the shape of its recording, that the integration reads every recording and that none keeps a secret, and fails when a double drifts.

  BOARD["A real board,<br/>Board Manager 1 or 2"] --> CAPTURE["scripts/capture_board.py:<br/>placeholders for its ID,<br/>its keys and its addresses"]
  CAPTURE --> RECORDINGS[("tests/fixtures/board_manager:<br/>1.0.7, 2.0.0, 2.0.2 and 2.1.0")]
  RECORDINGS --> UNIT["Double of the unit tests,<br/>tests/local_helpers.py"]
  RECORDINGS --> E2E["Double of the Docker<br/>end-to-end test,<br/>tests/e2e/board_mock.py"]
  UNIT --> CONTRACT{{"tests/test_board_contract.py:<br/>every route in the shape<br/>of its recording, every recording<br/>read by the integration,<br/>no secret"}}
  E2E --> CONTRACT
  CONTRACT -- "all alike" --> PASS["Both suites test<br/>the same board"]
  CONTRACT -- "a double drifts" --> FAIL["The tests fail"]

  classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
  classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
  classDef failed fill:#dc26262e,stroke:#dc2626,stroke-width:2px
  class RECORDINGS,CONTRACT bot
  class PASS done
  class FAIL failed
